                <pb facs="0742" n="654" xml:id="pg654"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Russell to Mr. Hay.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.—Paraphrase.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >American Legation</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                            >Panama</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian" when="1904-05-17"
                                ><hi rendition="#italic">May 17,
                    1904</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>(Mr. Russell reports that the special commission appointed by the National
                    Assembly to receive the amount due Panama will sail for New York to-morrow, and
                    that the Panaman Government urgently requests that the amount due be held until
                    the arrival of the commission.)</p>
            </div>
